# Model layer types

Use the `model-layer-types` skill when adding or moving types.

## Rule

**Declare all interfaces and types in the model layer** (`src/app/api/model/`). Do not define data-shape `interface` or `type` aliases in service modules, route handlers, or components.

| Shape | Path |
| --- | --- |
| API input | `model/request/` |
| API output / domain DTOs | `model/response/` |
| Enums + enum mappers | `model/enums/` |
| External provider JSON | `model/external/<provider>/` |

Services import types and implement fetch/map logic only.
